    <p>
      My name is Xavier, and I have always been passionate about technology, innovation, and the power they have to shape our future. 
      With over 8 years of experience in IT systems administration and DevOps, I have honed a solid foundation in infrastructure automation, cloud management, and system optimization. 
      Throughout my career, I’ve worked with diferent <strong>DevOps</strong> tools, which became my focus after completing my degree’s final project in cloud computing. 
