    </p>

    <p>
      But my life is not just about technology. Outside of work, I am deeply involved in music and outdoor activities. I am currently the leader of a folk music group where we play traditional Irish and Galician music, using instruments like the Irish whistle and bagpipes. 
      I also have a strong connection to traditional Mallorcan culture and participate actively in folklore dance, which allows me to keep my heritage alive.
    </p>

    <p>
